  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001101",
        "SRC-001110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The site holds 29 rent-controlled apartments; six were occupied as of July 2026. The 2021 approval included replacement affordable condos, relocation benefits covering the rent difference for 42 months, and a $4.8 million payment to the city for Gamel Way.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002577"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Aug. 28, 2026 the developer told the city it would include fewer affordable condos under the revised builder's remedy rules (13% instead of 20%). Tenants get relocation assistance and a right of first refusal to return to a new condo.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002576"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County parcel data: 154-21-007 is 584 Escuela Ave, 154-21-010 is 1945 Gamel Way, 154-21-011 is 1933 Gamel Way, 154-21-013 is 574 Escuela Ave. The 2018 state report row lists 154-21-010 through -013.",
      "src": [
